# This repo is developed on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites LF to
# CRLF on checkout. That is harmless for source files but breaks anything a Linux
# container executes: a shell script whose shebang line ends "#!/bin/sh\r" fails
# with "no such file or directory", naming the interpreter rather than the real
# problem. Pin the files that run inside our images to LF.
*.envsh text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
